{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34159","headline":"奉和袭美太湖诗二十首 雨中游包山精舍 · 陆龟蒙","name":"奉和袭美太湖诗二十首 雨中游包山精舍","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"包山信神仙，主者上真职。\n及栖钟梵侣，又是清凉域。\n乃知烟霞地，绝俗无不得。\n岩开一迳分，柏拥深殿黑。\n僧闲若图画，像古非雕刻。\n海客施明珠，湘蕤料净食。\n有鱼皆玉尾，有乌尽金臆。\n手携鞞铎佉，若在中印国。\n千峰残雨过，万籁清且极。\n此时空寂心，可以遗智识。\n知君战未胜，尚倚功名力。\n却下听经徒，孤帆有行色。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34159.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34159","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}